Sita calls Hanuman words poisoned nectar and urges hurry before deadline --- Sita cites tenth month with two months left and deaf Ravana --- Sita praises Rama valor that killed fourteen thousand in Janasthana --- Hanuman offers to carry Sita on back across ocean today --- Sita doubts small monkey can carry her far --- Hanuman grows mountain-like and claims power to carry Lanka --- Sita refuses flight fearing fall sea beasts battle peril and lost hiding --- Sita refuses touch of any but Rama and demands Rama fetch her killing Ravana --- Sita bids Hanuman bring Rama Lakshmana and troop lords quickly
